  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Integrated Logistics and Intermodal Transport Development Plan, through CPCS Transcom, Inc</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds technical assistance to support Thailand&apos;s Office of Transport and Traffic Policy and Planning (OTP) in developing specific recommended actions to promote the modal shift of freight traffic from road to rail in Thailand. The activity would identify infrastructure, technology, and operational improvements that would strengthen Thailand&apos;s intermodal transportation system and prepare detailed technical designs for three intermodal facilities. The activity is expected to lead to significant benefits for Thailand&apos;s transportation system, including reduced transport costs, decreased vehicle emissions, and improved road safety.</narrative>
  </description>
